Usage: grid proof add <item> <file|--text text> [--kind screenshot|video|log|check] [--by agent] [--note text] [--task <task>] [--json]
<task> is an id, exact folder name, or folder path inside a project tasks directory.
  -by string
    	evidence author (default "grid")
  -json
    	print JSON
  -kind string
    	evidence kind (default "check")
  -note string
    	one-line note
  -task string
    	task id or folder; defaults to the current task
  -text string
    	text evidence
